    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Menu",
      "Welcome\nWe welcome you onboard our flight\nto the United States\nwith a traditional Arabic welcome of open hands\n(Ahlan Wa Sahlan)\nHors d'auvres\nSelected Gourmet Delicacies\nSalad\nSeasonal Salad\nwith a choice of Dressing\nEntree\nYour choice of:\nRoast Sirloin of Beef\nSucculent Sirloin Roasted and carved on board\nChicken Valdostana\nBreast of Chicken stuffed with Gruyere\nCheese in a rich cream sauce\nHamour Meuniere Portugese\nFillets of Hamour fried in butter and\ndressed on a spicy onion and tomato sauce\nPlats Du Jour\nFlight Fancy\nVegetables\nRice - Anna Potatoes\nGreen Beans - Buttered Baby Carrots\nInternational Cheese Service\nOn the Cheese Board a selection of\nBlue Cheese - Gruyere - Edam - Camembert\naccompanied by an array of selected fresh fruit\nDessert\nGateau - Arabic Pastries\nCoffee - Tea - Milk - Nescafé - Fruit Juices - Soft Drinks\nLo,.\nLa Sul isla\nSPECIAL MENU\n•\n•"
    ],
